  "code": "2362",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1381\">\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1381\"><strong data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1314\">Genotype A:</strong> Common in Africa, North America &ndash; better response to interferon.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1459\">\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1459\"><strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1399\">Genotype B:</strong> Common in Asia &ndash; better prognosis, lower HCC risk than C.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1544\">\n<p data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1544\"><strong data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1477\">Genotype C:</strong> Common in Asia &ndash; associated with higher viral load and HCC risk.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1619\">\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1619\"><strong data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1562\">Genotype D:</strong> Common in India, Middle East &ndash; intermediate prognosis.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1667\">\n<p data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1667\"><strong data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1642\">Other genotypes:</strong> Rare, region-specific.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
